(3367795, 468696, 70000, '<td valign="top">Fantastic idea. The folds in the sheet in the background are really destracting though. Ironing helps. Also the light from the right is much stronger from that on the left and makes my eye draw to that corner instead of the really cool focus, her eye. More light on her face could help this.</td>', 'Fantastic idea. The folds in the sheet in the background are really destracting though. Ironing helps. Also the light from the right is much stronger from that on the left and makes my eye draw to that corner instead of the really cool focus, her eye. More light on her face could help this.', '2007-02-14 22:47:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3367801, 466902, 70000, '<td valign="top">This is a photo which I would like to see more depth of feild. The simple wave in the background has some great texture and it would be cool to have that in focus to sort of balance out the top of the photo with the bird. The lighting is nicely done though and the textures of the shells is neat.</td>', 'This is a photo which I would like to see more depth of feild. The simple wave in the background has some great texture and it would be cool to have that in focus to sort of balance out the top of the photo with the bird. The lighting is nicely done though and the textures of the shells is neat.', '2007-02-14 22:49:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3367803, 466949, 70000, '<td valign="top">wow i think this is cool but it mainly meets the challenge just through the title. I think in order to make it more clear that it is supposed to be an x-ray it would help to show more of the person''s body. It''s good having it out of focus but having more there would make it clear that it isn''t just a skeleton.</td>', 'wow i think this is cool but it mainly meets the challenge just through the title. I think in order to make it more clear that it is supposed to be an x-ray it would help to show more of the person''s body. It''s good having it out of focus but having more there would make it clear that it isn''t just a skeleton.', '2007-02-14 22:50:24.000000', NULL, 1),
