(3368149, 466889, 73799, '<td valign="top">I''m giving this a 9 because I''m a dental student. We didn''t bother with teeth in any of the biology classes that I took in high school or college.<br/> <br/>If you move the mirror in closer to the teeth the teeth would be magnified and fill up the mirror. I think I see a shelf and books in the top of the mirror.  And because the illumination is from behind I can''t make out much detain in the mirror.</td>', 'I''m giving this a 9 because I''m a dental student. We didn''t bother with teeth in any of the biology classes that I took in high school or college. If you move the mirror in closer to the teeth the teeth would be magnified and fill up the mirror. I think I see a shelf and books in the top of the mirror.  And because the illumination is from behind I can''t make out much detain in the mirror.', '2007-02-15 00:39:44.000000', NULL, 1),
