(3368536, 468696, 70661, '<td valign="top">I like this. I gave you a good score but IMO it would have been alot better with a different background. Great shot!</td>', 'I like this. I gave you a good score but IMO it would have been alot better with a different background. Great shot!', '2007-02-15 07:46:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3368541, 465788, 70661, '<td valign="top">When I was thinking of entering this challenge, that''s the only thing I could remember about biology class. You''ve captured my memory! LOL</td>', 'When I was thinking of entering this challenge, that''s the only thing I could remember about biology class. You''ve captured my memory! LOL', '2007-02-15 07:49:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3368569, 467212, 73141, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, but how did you manage to create it without spot editing?</td>', 'Nice picture, but how did you manage to create it without spot editing?', '2007-02-15 08:06:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3368600, 468683, 35352, '<td valign="top">I like how you''ve blended nature with lab work. The colours really work and the sunflower in the water drop is magical. Maybe the sunflower is a little too blurred. Great job!</td>', 'I like how you''ve blended nature with lab work. The colours really work and the sunflower in the water drop is magical. Maybe the sunflower is a little too blurred. Great job!', '2007-02-15 08:35:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3368604, 468509, 35352, '<td valign="top">This photo made me think about what you were trying to say. Very on topic!</td>', 'This photo made me think about what you were trying to say. Very on topic!', '2007-02-15 08:36:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3368609, 468307, 35352, '<td valign="top">Maybe a larger sample of tissue and colour correction of the yellow would of done this justice.</td>', 'Maybe a larger sample of tissue and colour correction of the yellow would of done this justice.', '2007-02-15 08:38:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3368616, 466634, 35352, '<td valign="top">Wow, the competition for space. The red earthy colour is great. I think the top half of the photo needs just a little more detail/focus.</td>', 'Wow, the competition for space. The red earthy colour is great. I think the top half of the photo needs just a little more detail/focus.', '2007-02-15 08:40:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3368617, 467025, 35352, '<td valign="top">So delicate, just like the focus. The colour is magnificant.</td>', 'So delicate, just like the focus. The colour is magnificant.', '2007-02-15 08:40:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3368621, 468386, 35352, '<td valign="top">Very informative. The simple colours also remind me of a textbook though I think the 2 greens in the photo clash a little.</td>', 'Very informative. The simple colours also remind me of a textbook though I think the 2 greens in the photo clash a little.', '2007-02-15 08:42:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3368628, 468155, 35352, '<td valign="top">I think this would of been better is there was a clear focal point - something to look at first and branch off so to speak. You do capture the randomness of nature though.</td>', 'I think this would of been better is there was a clear focal point - something to look at first and branch off so to speak. You do capture the randomness of nature though.', '2007-02-15 08:44:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3368630, 466693, 35352, '<td valign="top">Hmm, the potential of your subject. What will come out of this? Interesting colours.</td>', 'Hmm, the potential of your subject. What will come out of this? Interesting colours.', '2007-02-15 08:45:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3368635, 468419, 35352, '<td valign="top">I think your title - made me think who did design the colours. Nice framing!</td>', 'I think your title - made me think who did design the colours. Nice framing!', '2007-02-15 08:46:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3368653, 468442, 35352, '<td valign="top">I love this. So clever and thoughtful and so outside the square of the other photos. The label in the photo is classic and the effort you went to obviously shows. The bright red frame does distract a little from your masterpiece however.</td>', 'I love this. So clever and thoughtful and so outside the square of the other photos. The label in the photo is classic and the effort you went to obviously shows. The bright red frame does distract a little from your masterpiece however.', '2007-02-15 08:53:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3368655, 468398, 35352, '<td valign="top">Very clear, very well documented. Sharp focus, nice colours. Framed just right with the subject filling nice areas of the photo.</td>', 'Very clear, very well documented. Sharp focus, nice colours. Framed just right with the subject filling nice areas of the photo.', '2007-02-15 08:55:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3368660, 468675, 35352, '<td valign="top">The subject here - the insides - could be postitioned better higher up. Theres a lot of black hogging the top quarter of the photo. I think this would of been an excellent photo if framed better. Though from the xrays I''ve seen, that''s not always easy to do.</td>', 'The subject here - the insides - could be postitioned better higher up. Theres a lot of black hogging the top quarter of the photo. I think this would of been an excellent photo if framed better. Though from the xrays I''ve seen, that''s not always easy to do.', '2007-02-15 08:57:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3368661, 467457, 73414, '<td valign="top">You dawg!....Ha,just kidding.</td>', 'You dawg!....Ha,just kidding.', '2007-02-15 08:57:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3368664, 468532, 35352, '<td valign="top">I like where this photo is going. I imagine myself sitting at the end of the bench looking at whats going on. I think it needs to be framed a little better to see the subject more clearly and to delete some of the clutter in the foreground. There is also a yellow cast distracting.</td>', 'I like where this photo is going. I imagine myself sitting at the end of the bench looking at whats going on. I think it needs to be framed a little better to see the subject more clearly and to delete some of the clutter in the foreground. There is also a yellow cast distracting.', '2007-02-15 09:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3368669, 465563, 35352, '<td valign="top">There''s some nice contrast to this photo. I like the look that the bird is giving us.</td>', 'There''s some nice contrast to this photo. I like the look that the bird is giving us.', '2007-02-15 09:01:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3368715, 468592, 54265, '<td valign="top">I find this image too blurry and the blown out highlights bother me.</td>', 'I find this image too blurry and the blown out highlights bother me.', '2007-02-15 09:16:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3368718, 468395, 54265, '<td valign="top">I like this idea</td>', 'I like this idea', '2007-02-15 09:16:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3368719, 468257, 54265, '<td valign="top">Very nice</td>', 'Very nice', '2007-02-15 09:16:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3368804, 468359, 54265, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo</td>', 'I really like this photo', '2007-02-15 09:40:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3368848, 467712, 33532, '<td valign="top">yick</td>', 'yick', '2007-02-15 09:51:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3368982, 468695, 33532, '<td valign="top">ekk...this must be a Transylvania moth...*smile* I like the orientation you chose</td>', 'ekk...this must be a Transylvania moth...*smile* I like the orientation you chose', '2007-02-15 10:45:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3368991, 468668, 69102, '<td valign="top">not a bad idea. the lighting isn''t really highlighting the textures of teh onion very well, and the upper roots seem a little out of focus. this also perhaps would have been better with a lighter background. -5</td>', 'not a bad idea. the lighting isn''t really highlighting the textures of teh onion very well, and the upper roots seem a little out of focus. this also perhaps would have been better with a lighter background. -5', '2007-02-15 10:48:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3368994, 468327, 33532, '<td valign="top">creative!</td>', 'creative!', '2007-02-15 10:50:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3368996, 468398, 69102, '<td valign="top">nice composition; especially like the pollen/stamen(?) pieces in the middle right. its seems a little soft, which I don''t mind, generally, but given the dissection presentation, the softness seems a little out of place. - 7</td>', 'nice composition; especially like the pollen/stamen(?) pieces in the middle right. its seems a little soft, which I don''t mind, generally, but given the dissection presentation, the softness seems a little out of place. - 7', '2007-02-15 10:50:40.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(3368999, 468442, 69102, '<td valign="top">great idea, and very well shot and presented. - 8</td>', 'great idea, and very well shot and presented. - 8', '2007-02-15 10:51:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3369004, 467623, 69102, '<td valign="top">nice macro. like the background texture the leaf(?) gives. some of the details of the bug appear to get lost in the upper portion. - 7</td>', 'nice macro. like the background texture the leaf(?) gives. some of the details of the bug appear to get lost in the upper portion. - 7', '2007-02-15 10:52:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3369008, 465599, 67258, '<td valign="top">In terms of the challenge, I can relate to this entirely.  I do, though, wish that it was in much sharper focus - the problem is that you have selected such a narrow depth of field that the bean cannot be in focus at the same time as the shoot; whilst shallow dof is usually good in macro photography, in this case it is just too shallow.</td>', 'In terms of the challenge, I can relate to this entirely.  I do, though, wish that it was in much sharper focus - the problem is that you have selected such a narrow depth of field that the bean cannot be in focus at the same time as the shoot; whilst shallow dof is usually good in macro photography, in this case it is just too shallow.', '2007-02-15 10:53:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3369010, 466693, 66201, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous clarity - really well done and a nice example for the challenge.</td>', 'Gorgeous clarity - really well done and a nice example for the challenge.', '2007-02-15 10:53:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3369014, 468336, 69102, '<td valign="top">very nice. strong composition, with lots of stuff to get your eye exploring which could have made it too busy, but they don''t detract from the central image. - 8</td>', 'very nice. strong composition, with lots of stuff to get your eye exploring which could have made it too busy, but they don''t detract from the central image. - 8', '2007-02-15 10:54:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3369024, 468360, 67152, '<td valign="top">I love the textures that this photo shows - very nice use of lighting to show the detail of the leaf - and nice use of bokeh for the background. 8</td>', 'I love the textures that this photo shows - very nice use of lighting to show the detail of the leaf - and nice use of bokeh for the background. 8', '2007-02-15 10:57:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3369026, 467069, 69102, '<td valign="top">nice light and good focus. did you manage this handheld, or do they let tripods in? the only nit I have is the doors in the lower background, the blown out highlights don''t mesh with the soft, high light in the rest of the image and become a little distracting. if it was possible to push the angle up a little more, without having the skylights create the same effect as the door this might have been a little better. - 6</td>', 'nice light and good focus. did you manage this handheld, or do they let tripods in? the only nit I have is the doors in the lower background, the blown out highlights don''t mesh with the soft, high light in the rest of the image and become a little distracting. if it was possible to push the angle up a little more, without having the skylights create the same effect as the door this might have been a little better. - 6', '2007-02-15 10:57:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3369030, 467646, 69102, '<td valign="top">very old-school anatomy text. like the focus and background choice. border is a little thick and distracting. - 7</td>', 'very old-school anatomy text. like the focus and background choice. border is a little thick and distracting. - 7', '2007-02-15 10:58:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3369037, 465686, 69102, '<td valign="top">good school shot, like the girl looking ove the shoulder. perhaps either a little closer in, or a little farther back so that the child''s head was either fully in frame, or seemed more deliberately cut off. - 6</td>', 'good school shot, like the girl looking ove the shoulder. perhaps either a little closer in, or a little farther back so that the child''s head was either fully in frame, or seemed more deliberately cut off. - 6', '2007-02-15 10:59:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3369039, 468532, 69102, '<td valign="top">nice school shot. good composition and i like your use of the shallow dof and focus point. - 7</td>', 'nice school shot. good composition and i like your use of the shallow dof and focus point. - 7', '2007-02-15 11:00:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3369044, 466902, 69102, '<td valign="top">not bad. i get more of a "wildlife" vibe off this than a "biology" vibe. the wave in the background is a nice touch. - 6</td>', 'not bad. i get more of a "wildlife" vibe off this than a "biology" vibe. the wave in the background is a nice touch. - 6', '2007-02-15 11:01:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3369047, 467845, 69102, '<td valign="top">interesting still life shot. it seems either a little oversaturated or oversharpened, not sure which. also, given the setup, I would have liked the red drop cloth to be centered in the composition. - 6</td>', 'interesting still life shot. it seems either a little oversaturated or oversharpened, not sure which. also, given the setup, I would have liked the red drop cloth to be centered in the composition. - 6', '2007-02-15 11:02:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3369048, 467663, 69102, '<td valign="top">the cause of life is a water fountain? an out of focus water fountain? if you meant "water" then the water should have been in focus, but that still would have left me saying "huh?". - 3</td>', 'the cause of life is a water fountain? an out of focus water fountain? if you meant "water" then the water should have been in focus, but that still would have left me saying "huh?". - 3', '2007-02-15 11:04:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3369054, 468482, 69102, '<td valign="top">not sure how this conveys the idea of "biology." compositionally, this is too heavy on the bottom and right and the other hand, or whatever at top center is distracting. sorry - 3</td>', 'not sure how this conveys the idea of "biology." compositionally, this is too heavy on the bottom and right and the other hand, or whatever at top center is distracting. sorry - 3', '2007-02-15 11:05:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3369056, 467785, 69102, '<td valign="top">well it certainly does convey a sense of middle school humor. ;) otherwise, the shot is too dark and the lighting way too harsh. sorry - 3</td>', 'well it certainly does convey a sense of middle school humor. ;) otherwise, the shot is too dark and the lighting way too harsh. sorry - 3', '2007-02-15 11:07:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3369058, 468386, 69102, '<td valign="top">interesting. very school science project. works as "biology" but also "chemistry." ;) - 6</td>', 'interesting. very school science project. works as "biology" but also "chemistry." ;) - 6', '2007-02-15 11:08:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3369060, 467712, 69102, '<td valign="top">nice textures and colors. closest point on the worm is a little soft, but interesting composition and take on the challenge. - 7</td>', 'nice textures and colors. closest point on the worm is a little soft, but interesting composition and take on the challenge. - 7', '2007-02-15 11:09:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3369065, 467894, 69102, '<td valign="top">the crop cutting off the bottom and backside of your subject doesn''t work for me. leaves the composition very heavy to the lower left. this seems more like a "wildlife" rather than a "biology" shot. - 4</td>', 'the crop cutting off the bottom and backside of your subject doesn''t work for me. leaves the composition very heavy to the lower left. this seems more like a "wildlife" rather than a "biology" shot. - 4', '2007-02-15 11:10:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3369068, 467815, 69102, '<td valign="top">nice composition and colors. - 6</td>', 'nice composition and colors. - 6', '2007-02-15 11:11:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3369069, 468332, 33532, '<td valign="top">This guy reminds me of the worms on MIB. Nice capture!</td>', 'This guy reminds me of the worms on MIB. Nice capture!', '2007-02-15 11:11:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3369072, 468420, 69102, '<td valign="top">shot seems a little flat and composition is too busy and cluttered. the sign post merging with the duck and its bill doesn''t work compositionally. also, not a very flattering angle on the duck. sorry - 3</td>', 'shot seems a little flat and composition is too busy and cluttered. the sign post merging with the duck and its bill doesn''t work compositionally. also, not a very flattering angle on the duck. sorry - 3', '2007-02-15 11:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3369076, 468327, 69102, '<td valign="top">interesting shot. i think you''re holding the xray a little high. using the laptop actually detracts from the image. would have been better to use a print of the xray image, suggesting an actual xray slide. - 5</td>', 'interesting shot. i think you''re holding the xray a little high. using the laptop actually detracts from the image. would have been better to use a print of the xray image, suggesting an actual xray slide. - 5', '2007-02-15 11:14:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3369079, 466842, 66201, '<td valign="top">Neat, clean, precise: should do well.</td>', 'Neat, clean, precise: should do well.', '2007-02-15 11:15:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3369080, 468529, 69102, '<td valign="top">cool. interested to find out what these actually are. good, slimy green color. ;) - 7</td>', 'cool. interested to find out what these actually are. good, slimy green color. ;) - 7', '2007-02-15 11:15:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3369085, 465599, 69102, '<td valign="top">good idea. there is a lot of interesting texture to explore here, and I wish that you hadn''t used such a shallow dof. compositionally, i would push the pea to the left so that there wasn''t so much dead space on that side. - 6</td>', 'good idea. there is a lot of interesting texture to explore here, and I wish that you hadn''t used such a shallow dof. compositionally, i would push the pea to the left so that there wasn''t so much dead space on that side. - 6', '2007-02-15 11:16:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3369086, 468695, 66201, '<td valign="top">You should have left this in the landscape orientation: it looks weird this way up, as if the moth is leaning against a wall...Nice detail and focus though.</td>', 'You should have left this in the landscape orientation: it looks weird this way up, as if the moth is leaning against a wall...Nice detail and focus though.', '2007-02-15 11:16:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3369087, 467457, 69102, '<td valign="top">just looks like a tacky vacation snapshot. sorry - 2</td>', 'just looks like a tacky vacation snapshot. sorry - 2', '2007-02-15 11:17:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3369090, 467846, 69102, '<td valign="top">interesting idea. shot looks too dark to me and the texture/light on the apple is very flat. - 5</td>', 'interesting idea. shot looks too dark to me and the texture/light on the apple is very flat. - 5', '2007-02-15 11:18:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3369094, 468696, 69102, '<td valign="top">interesting idea. the sheet in the background is distracting. needs either to have been ironed or to have been blurred out using a shallower dof. would be better if we saw just a little more of the girl''s face as well. - 5</td>', 'interesting idea. the sheet in the background is distracting. needs either to have been ironed or to have been blurred out using a shallower dof. would be better if we saw just a little more of the girl''s face as well. - 5', '2007-02-15 11:19:47.000000', NULL, 1),
