(3396340, 466011, 60862, '<td valign="top">Great shot, Crystal!  I laughed out loud when I saw this one - just inspired. :)</td>', 'Great shot, Crystal!  I laughed out loud when I saw this one - just inspired. :)', '2007-02-23 01:46:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(3396804, 467757, 67145, '<td valign="top">congrats on an excellent score and a wonderful photograph ... love the crisp, sharp, focussed heads and love their colouring .. the dof is perfect ... we get frogs around here after rain and yeah .. they are noisy buggers!!! .. but we dont get beautiful colourful ones like these two .. ours are usually a dirty muddy unpleasant brown colour and very occasionally the plain green ones ...  this is a great capture and extremely funny .. <br/><i>edit ... </i>  i find this pretty funny, but i''m thinking that some ppl might find it offensive, coz i thought dpc had rules and regs about porn ... i suppose the fact that you cant see their ''areas'' makes this an artistic, tasteful and acceptable image!!! .. lol ... :)<br/><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-02-23 06:11:30.</i></td>', 'congrats on an excellent score and a wonderful photograph ... love the crisp, sharp, focussed heads and love their colouring .. the dof is perfect ... we get frogs around here after rain and yeah .. they are noisy buggers!!! .. but we dont get beautiful colourful ones like these two .. ours are usually a dirty muddy unpleasant brown colour and very occasionally the plain green ones ...  this is a great capture and extremely funny .. edit ...   i find this pretty funny, but i''m thinking that some ppl might find it offensive, coz i thought dpc had rules and regs about porn ... i suppose the fact that you cant see their ''areas'' makes this an artistic, tasteful and acceptable image!!! .. lol ... :)', '2007-02-23 06:05:39.000000', '2007-02-23 06:11:30.000000', 0),
