(3398158, 466011, 43774, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by jaded_youth:</b></div><hr/><i> <br/>That''s cool. this is the shot i was inspired by. I thought maybe you had just seen it before. I guess there are a lot of these around. lol.<a href="//www.deviantart.com/deviation/28484443/" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">//www.deviantart.com/deviation/28484443/</a> </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>No I''ve never seen that one before, I''ve never been to Deviant Art before although I''ve heard of it. I think I saw it in an ad in a magazine once, years ago. I know it wasn''t my original idea.</td>', 'Originally posted by jaded_youth: That''s cool. this is the shot i was inspired by. I thought maybe you had just seen it before. I guess there are a lot of these around. lol.//www.deviantart.com/deviation/28484443/   No I''ve never seen that one before, I''ve never been to Deviant Art before although I''ve heard of it. I think I saw it in an ad in a magazine once, years ago. I know it wasn''t my original idea.', '2007-02-23 14:12:41.000000', NULL, 0),
