(3411480, 467646, 67841, '<td valign="top">I really like the tones &amp; shallow DOF on this - I think this was well done, congrats!  Oddly, the only thing that disturbs me is the little tuft of hair - with no justifiable reason other than it interrupts the totality of skin here!</td>', 'I really like the tones & shallow DOF on this - I think this was well done, congrats!  Oddly, the only thing that disturbs me is the little tuft of hair - with no justifiable reason other than it interrupts the totality of skin here!', '2007-02-27 23:39:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(3420043, 468504, 33672, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 5 too. I don''t know... I agree with those who said the focal point is too far back and the POV is kind of generic. I like the title and maybe a closer crop would''ve worked better.</td>', 'I gave this a 5 too. I don''t know... I agree with those who said the focal point is too far back and the POV is kind of generic. I like the title and maybe a closer crop would''ve worked better.', '2007-03-01 18:34:07.000000', NULL, 0),
