(3484240, 468336, 45524, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the great score. I''m not sure how I missed commenting on this shot before. This is really nice composition and great idea and execution for the challenge.</td>', 'Congrats on the great score. I''m not sure how I missed commenting on this shot before. This is really nice composition and great idea and execution for the challenge.', '2007-03-23 19:53:31.000000', NULL, 0),
