(3770456, 467623, 2158, '<td valign="top">What a gorgeous photo.  The texture in those wings is amazing.</td>', 'What a gorgeous photo.  The texture in those wings is amazing.', '2007-06-11 22:38:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(3829716, 468670, 14986, '<td valign="top">I just love this idea and wish the technical aspects would carry it better.  Out of focus, yes...but also not much attention to creating a pleasing composition and lines.  Also very shadowy and unappealing lighting.  I don''t mean to be harsh.  Looking over your portfolio to make comments, it seems you love to take pictures!  That''s great!  I hope hanging around here will encourage some creative growth in working on the basics like composition, lighting, and clarity.  It seems you have some really good ideas, but need to take the extra time to double check these things.   I''m no expert, so take my critique as you will  :)</td>', 'I just love this idea and wish the technical aspects would carry it better.  Out of focus, yes...but also not much attention to creating a pleasing composition and lines.  Also very shadowy and unappealing lighting.  I don''t mean to be harsh.  Looking over your portfolio to make comments, it seems you love to take pictures!  That''s great!  I hope hanging around here will encourage some creative growth in working on the basics like composition, lighting, and clarity.  It seems you have some really good ideas, but need to take the extra time to double check these things.   I''m no expert, so take my critique as you will  :)', '2007-06-25 00:39:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(3845593, 467757, 5885, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by crayon:</b></div><hr/><i> i wanna be a frog too.<br/> </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I don''t think she''s all that hot :-))</td>', 'Originally posted by crayon: i wanna be a frog too.   I don''t think she''s all that hot :-))', '2007-06-28 15:09:56.000000', NULL, 0),
